  "description": "Dive into Zombie Catchers: Hunt & Sell - available for free download and simple installation. Completely secure with no viruses or malware. Always easily access the most recent version.",
  "editor_review": "Are you in search of an entertaining and thrilling game? Look no further! Zombie Catchers is here to quench your zombie hunting desires! In this casual action-adventure title, join A.J. and Bud as they create a business empire by capturing zombies and selling Zombie Juice. Armed with your reliable harpoon gun and clever traps, hunt and snatch juicy zombies, craft delicious juices and snacks, and establish your own food business empire. Discover new locations, hunt down unique boss zombies, and rise through the hunting ranks to gain access to special costumes for your character. Prepare to catch zombies and reap profits in this futuristic realm invaded by the undead!",
